{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cfpf3w2hQX5PQqX6imaZ1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Discount Approval Decision: DR-9112\n\n## Analysis\n\n**Step 1: The Request**\n- Request ID: DR-9112\n- Customer: Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048)\n- Product: NS-500\n- Requested discount: 18.0%\n- Date: 2026-09-23\n- Requestor: michael.torres@northstar.example\n- Basis: Contract pricing (Acme Master Supply Agreement)\n\n**Step 2: Customer Identity**\n- CRM account: Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048)\n- ERP customer: Acme Mfg. Holdings (C-1001)\n- DUNS: 04-812-7730\n- Match confirmed\n\n**Step 3: Product**\n- SKU: NS-500 Industrial Controller\n- List price: $250,000\n\n**Step 4: Active Contract**\nACME-MFG-2025 is effective 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31. The request date (2026-09-23) falls within this period. **Active contract exists.**\n\n**Step 5: Pricing Exception**\nEXC-ACME-NS500-15 is registered and in force 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31. It applies to:\n- Customer: Acme Mfg. Holdings (CRM-2048)\n- Product: NS-500 only\n- **Maximum discount: 15% of list price**\n\nThe exception explicitly states it \"establishes commercial eligibility only. It does not grant approval authority to any Northstar employee.\"\n\n**Step 6: Policy in Effect**\nRequest date 2026-09-23 falls in calendar 2026, so **PRICING-POLICY-2026** applies:\n- Enterprise Account Executives: ≤10%\n- VP Sales: >10% and ≤20%\n- Chief Revenue Officer: >20%\n\n**Step 7: Requestor's Authority**\nMichael Torres (michael.torres@northstar.example) is employed as VP Sales (EMP-200). Under PRICING-POLICY-2026, VP Sales may approve discounts exceeding 10% and up to 20%. An 18% discount falls within his authority band.\n\n**Step 8: The Critical Issue**\nThe requested discount of **18% exceeds the customer's established commercial eligibility maximum of 15%** per EXC-ACME-NS500-15. \n\nAlthough Michael Torres holds authority to approve up to 20%, authority does not override commercial eligibility. The pricing exception is scoped to a maximum of 15% and cannot be exceeded by employee approval alone. Per the decision principles: \"A request must not be approved solely because a customer contract permits the requested discount.\"\n\nThe outcome guidance is explicit: \"The discount exceeds the customer's established eligibility (e.g. above an exception's maximum). A higher approver does not fix this; it needs new or amended terms.\"\n\n**Step 9: Decision**\nThe discount cannot be approved under current commercial terms. The customer would need either:\n- Amendment to EXC-ACME-NS500-15 to raise the maximum above 15%, or\n- New pricing terms negotiated through Legal and Deal Desk\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"REJECT_OR_ESCALATE\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9112\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048)\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-500\",\n    \"requested_discount\": \"18.0%\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"michael.torres@northstar.example\",\n    \"basis\": \"contract_exception\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"exceeded\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": \"15%\",\n    \"basis\": \"EXC-ACME-NS500-15 (pricing exception under ACME-MFG-2025)\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"PRICING-POLICY-2026\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": \"20%\",\n    \"requestor_authorized\": true,\n    \"required_role\": null,\n    \"approver\": null\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"DR-9112 from discount_requests.csv\",\n    \"ACME-MFG-2025 (registered customer agreement, effective 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31)\",\n    \"EXC-ACME-NS500-15 (registered pricing exception for NS-500, maximum 15%, effective 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31)\",\n    \"PRICING-POLICY-2026 (in force on request date)\",\n    \"Approval Authority Matrix 2026\",\n    \"employees.csv (Michael Torres confirmed as VP Sales)\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": []\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5921,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5921},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c94e41f7-7cd5-4129-8c9e-25d3016307e9","uuid":"951ef8bf-4418-4d9c-a112-70f1e10d885a","timestamp":"2026-10-08T11:02:51.550Z","request_id":"req_011Cfpf3vooQUVWpHaUoyTSs"}
